flowchart LR
    typed[Typed scalar loads and stores] --> live[Live slots before definitions]
    typed --> cfg[Reachability and immediate dominators]
    cfg --> df[Dominance frontiers]
    live --> phi[Pruned iterated frontier insertion]
    df --> phi
    phi --> rename[Dominator tree renaming with undo stack]
    rename --> verify[Unique definitions and edge dominance verification]
    verify --> split[Critical edge splitting]
    split --> allocation[CFG liveness and physical allocation]
    allocation --> copies[Edge parallel copies with cycle temporaries]
    copies --> native[Original encoder and ELF output]
